# Deny everything, then allow back exactly what the build needs.
#
# A denylist has to be right about every future file; this has to be right
# about the few that matter. A `.env` written next to this file, a key dropped
# in the working tree, a new test directory — none of them reach the build
# context unless someone adds them below, deliberately and visibly in review.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src
!migrations

# `src` and `migrations` are allowed wholesale above, so re-exclude anything
# that could be dropped inside them and does not belong in an image.
**/*.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
